  "descriptionHtml": "<div class=\"product-highlights\" style=\"margin-bottom:16px;\"><span style=\"display:inline-block;background:#f3f4f6;color:#1f2937;padding:3px 10px;border-radius:12px;font-size:12px;margin:2px 4px 2px 0;font-weight:500;\">✓ Hydrating</span><span style=\"display:inline-block;background:#f3f4f6;color:#1f2937;padding:3px 10px;border-radius:12px;font-size:12px;margin:2px 4px 2px 0;font-weight:500;\">✓ Clean at Sephora</span><span style=\"display:inline-block;background:#f3f4f6;color:#1f2937;padding:3px 10px;border-radius:12px;font-size:12px;margin:2px 4px 2px 0;font-weight:500;\">✓ Vegan</span><span style=\"display:inline-block;background:#f3f4f6;color:#1f2937;padding:3px 10px;border-radius:12px;font-size:12px;margin:2px 4px 2px 0;font-weight:500;\">✓ Cruelty-Free</span><span style=\"display:inline-block;background:#f3f4f6;color:#1f2937;padding:3px 10px;border-radius:12px;font-size:12px;margin:2px 4px 2px 0;font-weight:500;\">✓ Non-Comedogenic</span><span style=\"display:inline-block;background:#f3f4f6;color:#1f2937;padding:3px 10px;border-radius:12px;font-size:12px;margin:2px 4px 2px 0;font-weight:500;\">✓ Long-wearing</span></div>\n<div class=\"product-description-main\" style=\"margin-bottom:20px;line-height:1.6;\"><strong>What it is: </strong>Talc-free blush with redness reducing fermented arnica and hydrating squalane and hydraberry. One swipe, blendable color that lasts all day.<br><br><strong>Finish: </strong>Natural<br><strong><br>Formulation: </strong>Pressed Powder<br><strong><br>Highlighted Ingredients: <br></strong>- Fermented Arnica: Visibly reduces redness and irritation<br>- Hydraberry: Extracted from red raspberries, delivers immediate and long range skin hydration and supports the skin barrier<br>- Plant Squalane: Nourishes and softens skin<br><br><strong>Ingredient Callouts:</strong> Free of parabens, formaldehydes, formaldehyde-releasing agents, phthalates, mineral oil, retinyl palmitate, oxybenzone, coal tar, hydroquinone, sulfates SLS & SLES, triclocarban, triclosan,</div>\n<details class=\"size-guide-accordion\" style=\"margin-top:16px;border-top:1px solid #e5e7eb;padding-top:12px;\"><summary style=\"font-weight:600;font-size:15px;cursor:pointer;padding:6px 0;outline:none;display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:center;\"><span>How to Use</span><span style=\"font-size:18px;color:#6b7280;\">+</span></summary><div style=\"padding:12px 0 6px 0;line-height:1.6;color:#374151;\"><strong>Suggested Usage:<br></strong>-Use the Haus Labs Dual-Ended Multi-Purpose Brush (sold separately) to apply and diffuse.<br>-Build for intensity.<br>-For an even more radiant, dimensional finish, top with any shade of Bio-Radiant Gel-Powder Highlighter with Fermented Arnica (sold separately).</div></details>\n<details class=\"size-guide-accordion\" style=\"margin-top:12px;border-top:1px solid #e5e7eb;border-bottom:1px solid #e5e7eb;padding:12px 0;\"><summary style=\"font-weight:600;font-size:15px;cursor:pointer;padding:6px 0;outline:none;display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:center;\"><span>Ingredients</span><span style=\"font-size:18px;color:#6b7280;\">+</span></summary><div style=\"padding:12px 0 6px 0;line-height:1.6;color:#374151;font-size:13px;\">-Fermented Arnica: Protects against environmental stress.<br>-Vitamins C and E: Skin feels protected and conditioned.<br>-Plant Squalane: Skin feels nourished and soft. <br><br>Synthetic Fluorphlogopite, Mica, Silica, C30-45 Alkyl Dimethicone, Butyrospermum Parkii (Shea) Butter, Squalane, Sorbitan Isostearate, C20-24 Alkyl Dimethicone, Arnica Montana Flower Extract**, Pseudozyma Epicola/Sunflower Seed Oil Ferment Extract Filtrate, Tocopherol, Ascorbyl Palmitate, Tocopheryl Acetate, Rubus Idaeus (Raspberry) Leaf Extract, Glycerin, Caprylic/Capric Triglyceride, Caprylyl Glycol, Ethylhexylglycerin, Pentaerythrityl Tetra-Di-T-Butyl Hydroxyhydrocinnamate, C20-24 Olefin, Zinc Stearate, Triethoxycaprylylsilane, Aluminium Hydroxide, Alumina, CI 77492/77499 (Iron Oxides), CI 15850 (Red 7), CI 77891 (Titanium Dioxide), CI 19140 (Yellow 5 Lake).<br><br>**Fermented.<br><br><i>The list of ingredients is subject to change, please consult the packaging of the product purchased.</i></div></details>",
